					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Dominus benedicat tibi et domui tuae omnibusque <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>piis et amicis nostris!</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nihil equidem iam a <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>5 septimanis accepi literarum ab amicis meis; <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ideo nihil scribere potui.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed et toto isto tempore <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>occupationibus oppressus non admodum firma sum va<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>letudine.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quae tamen accepi <placeName ref="l491">Argentorato</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>misi d. <persName ref="p8246">Ruinellae</persName> ea lege, ut et tibi communicet.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Petit rex iterum <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> 6000; non enim <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>satis est in expeditione priore plures periisse.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Si conceduntur illi, argumentum est occaecationis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et indurationis Pharaonicae.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nostri <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>districtissime omnem prohibent militiam.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Welche nun ziehend, wöllend mitt gwallt <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>verderben.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Da ist kein gällt, dann alein <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>zum uffbruch wyt zamen geschaben; da <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>inn in <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> ist wäder ze byssen noch <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>zuͦ brächen und das land übel verwuͤst.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Wil nun yemandts verdärben, mag er wol <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>one danck gotts und der wällt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Haec sunt dei <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>iudicia horrenda.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dominus misereatur <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nostri et servet nos a malo!</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Vil un<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>falls und ellendts ist allenthalb; gott <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>besser es!</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Utinam iudicio suo mox dirimat <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>hanc pugnam in mundo!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Celerrime has scripsi.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">13. ianuarii 1570.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">H[einr<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ychus] Bullingerus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>senior tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Saluta dominos et amicos <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nostros, tuam quoque familiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8016">Tobiae <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Eglio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fideli ministro, domino meo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et fratri honorando et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>dilecto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>An den herren pfarrer <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>zuͦ Sant Martin zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName> h. <persName ref="p8016">Tobia Egli</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>